000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. CONDGRP.
000300* Nucleus level 2 conditions: abbreviated combined relations,
000400* comparison of alphanumeric items of unequal size, and level-88
000500* VALUE ... THRU and VALUE series.
000600 DATA DIVISION.
000700 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000800 01  A            PIC 9(3) VALUE 5.
000900 01  B            PIC 9(3) VALUE 7.
001000 01  X3           PIC X(3) VALUE 'AB'.
001100 01  X7           PIC X(7) VALUE 'AB'.
001200 01  Y7           PIC X(7) VALUE 'ABC'.
001300 01  T.
001400     05  E OCCURS 3 TIMES PIC X(5).
001500 01  G            PIC 99 VALUE 0.
001600     88  G-LOW    VALUE 1 THRU 9.
001700     88  G-SOME   VALUE 3 5 7 20 THRU 29.
001800 01  C            PIC X VALUE 'M'.
001900     88  C-ALPHA  VALUE 'A' THRU 'Z'.
002000     88  C-VOWEL  VALUE 'A' 'E' 'I' 'O' 'U'.
002100 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
002200 MAIN.
002300     IF A = 1 OR 5 OR 9 DISPLAY 'ABBR 1 OK'.
002400     IF A = 1 OR 2 OR 3 DISPLAY 'ABBR 2 WRONG'
002500         ELSE DISPLAY 'ABBR 2 OK'.
002600     IF A > 1 AND < 100 DISPLAY 'ABBR 3 OK'.
002700     IF A > 1 AND NOT > 4 DISPLAY 'ABBR 4 WRONG'
002800         ELSE DISPLAY 'ABBR 4 OK'.
002900     IF A = 3 OR B DISPLAY 'ABBR 5 WRONG'
003000         ELSE DISPLAY 'ABBR 5 OK'.
003100     MOVE 7 TO A.
003200     IF A = 3 OR B DISPLAY 'ABBR 6 OK'.
003300     IF X3 = 'A' OR 'AB' OR 'ABC' DISPLAY 'ABBR 7 OK'.
003400     IF A = 7 AND B = 7 OR 8 DISPLAY 'ABBR 8 OK'.
003500     IF X3 = X7 DISPLAY 'UNEQ 1 OK'.
003600     IF X7 = X3 DISPLAY 'UNEQ 2 OK'.
003700     IF X3 NOT = Y7 DISPLAY 'UNEQ 3 OK'.
003800     IF X3 < Y7 DISPLAY 'UNEQ 4 OK'.
003900     IF Y7 > X3 DISPLAY 'UNEQ 5 OK'.
004000     IF X3 = 'AB     ' DISPLAY 'UNEQ 6 OK'.
004100     IF X3 = 'AB    X' DISPLAY 'UNEQ 7 WRONG'
004200         ELSE DISPLAY 'UNEQ 7 OK'.
004300     MOVE 'AB' TO E (2).
004400     IF E (2) = X3 DISPLAY 'UNEQ 8 OK'.
004500     IF X7 = E (2) DISPLAY 'UNEQ 9 OK'.
004600     MOVE 0 TO G.
004700     IF G-LOW DISPLAY '88 1 WRONG' ELSE DISPLAY '88 1 OK'.
004800     MOVE 9 TO G.
004900     IF G-LOW DISPLAY '88 2 OK'.
005000     IF G-SOME DISPLAY '88 3 WRONG' ELSE DISPLAY '88 3 OK'.
005100     MOVE 7 TO G.
005200     IF G-SOME DISPLAY '88 4 OK'.
005300     MOVE 25 TO G.
005400     IF G-SOME DISPLAY '88 5 OK'.
005500     IF NOT G-LOW DISPLAY '88 6 OK'.
005600     IF C-ALPHA DISPLAY '88 7 OK'.
005700     IF C-VOWEL DISPLAY '88 8 WRONG' ELSE DISPLAY '88 8 OK'.
005800     MOVE 'O' TO C.
005900     IF C-VOWEL DISPLAY '88 9 OK'.
006000     STOP RUN.
